alpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114027346","verified_at":"2026-10-21T09:19:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5028910-1846651706679774","game_id":"steam-5028910","kind":"announcement","title":"PlayCard is Ready for You","summary":"Playcard Football 0.8 · The Facility Update Your program finally has a building. This release (0.8) turns the career screens into rooms you walk between, brings the league to life with a weekly social feed and real football stats, and rebuilds game day from the play call to the final whistle. Welcome to the facility A row of brass room placards now runs across the top, and each room changes its look as you climb from High School to College to the Pros. Press 1 to 6 to jump between them. Office. ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T01:38:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706679774","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:40:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5028910-1846018067931548","game_id":"steam-5028910","kind":"update","title":"Patch update","summary":"PlayCard Football update:This update is about one main thing: when a play resolves, the analysis screen should tell you a little better why it went the way it did. The numbers, the words and the result now display the information in a more digestible format. The matchup, rebuiltMATCHUP is now a signed number. 0 is an even play, plus means it’s tilted the players way, minus means the opponents'. The scorecard adds up. The two big rows now carry numbers and sum to the matchup. CALL is everything a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T22:10:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067931548","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:40:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5028910-1845383656384231","game_id":"steam-5028910","kind":"announcement","title":"Dev Journal 3","summary":"Game theory is always at play in football. Today I will talk about size, and how I built it. Step 1In PlayCard football, you have to declare your offensive personnel. It is easier in high school, and personnel packages get more complicated at the college and pro levels. Coaching todayIn the 2026 season, if you follow professional leagues, you will undoubtably have heard or will hear about 13 personnel.1 = Backs 3 = TEThere are 11 players on the field. 6 are spoken for offensively1-QB5-OL That le","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T22:21:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656384231","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:40:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5028910-1844751498232945","game_id":"steam-5028910","kind":"update","title":"Patch Update","summary":"PlayCard Football v 0.7.5bNew: watch your key plays back After a game, the Film Session picks out your best play, your worst play, and the play where you got fooled. You can now tap any of them to watch that play run again on the field. League simulation adjustmentStronger teams now beat weaker teams much more often in games between other teams in your league. Before, even big mismatches were close to a coin flip, so the standings often didn't reflect who was actually good.Home teams now get an ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T02:06:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498232945","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:40:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5028910-1844115010497806","game_id":"steam-5028910","kind":"announcement","title":"Dev Journal 2","summary":"Playing football games, more than I can count, I was looking for something new to interact with. I didn't want to micromanage a team, but i did want to manage a team. I wanted to deal with building a profile like a defensive mastermind but I didn't want to have to deal with hundreds of plays to choose from. I wanted to have my players affect the game, but I didn't want to have to know which Wide receiver was good at contested catches, and which one was just a speed demon. One of the problems we ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-19T19:49:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010497806","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:40:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5028910-1844115010493745","game_id":"steam-5028910","kind":"announcement","title":"Dev Journal 1","summary":"I've been playing football video games since Tecmo bowl.I've been working on this football game for 5 years. Wanted to make a game that felt the way football feels; with the players, strategy and play calling that makes it the \"physical chess\" that many people can see. I'm very lucky to say I've created a version of a game that captures all of that.In this game you are a coach. You manage a team of players, but instead of the 55 roster spots, I've reduced it to the 11 units.Instead of the 100 pl","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-18T03:32:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010493745","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:40:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5028910":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:16:37Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:16:36Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5028910":"202